[User] Do we need both buses slice and busIndex map in Circuit? Can we just iterate the map?

[Claude] Explained trade-off: map-only loses deterministic output order (Go map iteration is non-deterministic); slice-only loses O(1) lookup needed during ToGeoJSON for every line/vsource coordinate resolution. User chose to keep both.

[User] Can NewBusID be simplified with a regex?

[Claude] Replaced multi-step SplitN logic with a compiled package-level regex: `^(\d+)[_.]|^([^.]+)`. First alternative captures a numeric prefix before _ or .; second captures everything before the first dot. Eliminates strconv.Atoi check.

[User] Can splitLines be dramatically simplified?

[Claude] Reduced 20-line manual byte-walk to one line: strings.Split(strings.ReplaceAll(s, "\r\n", "\n"), "\n"). Empty line filtering remains at the call site in LoadCircuitModel.

